{"text":"But more than anything, Harvard has produced the men and women on whose talents our society become functional, the leaders who remain learners and the learners who become leaders in classic disciplines and religious dimension in modern technologies and social processes. And events four decades ago put me on a path that has led me to where I am today. I participated as a junior official of Liberia's then Department of Treasury in a National Development Conference sponsored by our National Planning Council and a team of Harvard Aversas working with Liberia. My remarks, which challenged the status quo, landed me in my first political trouble.","words":[{"text":"But","start":0.0,"end":0.64},{"text":"more","start":0.64,"end":0.88},{"text":"than","start":0.88,"end":1.08},{"text":"anything","start":1.08,"end":1.94,"punct":","},{"text":"Harvard","start":2.6,"end":3.02},{"text":"has","start":3.02,"end":3.26},{"text":"produced","start":3.26,"end":3.68},{"text":"the","start":3.68,"end":3.94},{"text":"men","start":3.94,"end":4.26},{"text":"and","start":4.26,"end":4.42},{"text":"women","start":4.42,"end":4.74},{"text":"on","start":4.74,"end":5.62},{"text":"whose","start":5.62,"end":5.92},{"text":"talents","start":5.92,"end":6.4},{"text":"our","start":6.4,"end":6.72},{"text":"society","start":6.72,"end":7.26},{"text":"become","start":7.26,"end":7.76},{"text":"functional","start":7.76,"end":8.4,"punct":","},{"text":"the","start":9.88,"end":10.04},{"text":"leaders","start":10.04,"end":10.46},{"text":"who","start":10.46,"end":11.58},{"text":"remain","start":11.58,"end":11.94},{"text":"learners","start":11.94,"end":12.42},{"text":"and","start":12.42,"end":13.86},{"text":"the","start":13.86,"end":13.98},{"text":"learners","start":13.98,"end":14.42},{"text":"who","start":14.42,"end":15.32},{"text":"become","start":15.32,"end":15.66},{"text":"leaders","start":15.66,"end":16.08},{"text":"in","start":16.78,"end":17.26},{"text":"classic","start":17.26,"end":17.8},{"text":"discipli